    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The one-bedroom apartment at Mount Auburn Park is a beautifully proportioned own-door residence, designed to combine privacy, contemporary style and exceptional use of space.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully arranged on ground floor level, with a private entrance hall connecting the principal spaces of the home. A generous bedroom, beautifully appointed bathroom and bright open-plan kitchen, living and dining area are all independently accessed, creating a practical and well-balanced layout. A separate utility and dedicated storage add everyday convenience, while the terrace provides an attractive extension of the living space outdoors. Beyond the terrace, the apartment enjoys an impressive private garden extending to approximately 65 sq m, offering a generous and secluded outdoor space for relaxing, dining and entertaining."
      },
